window.products.push({"id":190197,"name":"on Amazon King Size Sheets Luxury Soft 550-TC Egyptian Cotton - Sheet Set for King Size (76x80) Mattress Fits 14-16 Inches Fully Elastic Deep Pocket (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":91.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vG2ns+7SL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"100% Satisfaction Guarantee LUXURY AND COMFORT: Experience the grandeur of 5 Star indulgence when you sleep in these super soft 100% Egyptian Cotton Sheets. This exquisite Sheet Set has been painstakingly crafted from the finest 100% Long Staple Cotton yarns keeping your comfort in mind. CLASSIC TAILORED LOOK WITH DEEP POCKETS:  AFFORDABLE LUXURY: Create a welcoming environment and a restful feeling in the bedroom with this TOP QUALITY and AFFORDABLE Bedding Collection. OUR MISSION: We at Comfy Sheets are on a mission to become the most customer centric seller on Amazon and are constantly working hard towards achieving the same.  Home Washable Wash them on the Normal cycle and remove sheets from the dryer quickly to keep them wrinkle-free. Keep hues bright and avoid using chlorine or color-safe bleach on colored sheets. Iron your pillow cases for that brand-new feel. Wash linens separately from items with zippers to keep them from pilling. Add detergent to the water instead of pouring it right onto your sheets. Material- 100% Egyptian Cotton We use High strength durable stitching threads, Premium quality long lasting Elastic on fitted sheets and Leave Optimum Pocket depth to fit standard and deep mattresses. Every yard of fabric we use is inspected at every stage and each sheet set is again individually inspected before being packed and shipped from the factory. By offering impeccable Quality Controls and Versatility, Sheets will enable you to elevate your sleep experience from ordinary to Extra-Ordinary. Each of our piece is individually Inspected before being packed and shipped.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vG2ns+7SL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sophia Cotton Club","source_asin":"B0BN68HB58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN68HB58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN68HB58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190198,"name":"Vintage Styled Handmade Moroccan Silver Plated Teapot with Built In Tea Infuser Filter, Bring Home a Beautifully Functional Near East Tradition, 34 Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RqbbXLR5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring this stunning silver Moroccan style teapot into your home and fall in love with its mystique , its beauty and its functionality. Handmade in Fez, the old imperial capital of Morocco located just northeast of the Atlas Mountains, by artisanal silversmiths using traditional methods and materials. With a built-in tea infuser filter and a 34oz capacity, this tea kettle is the perfect size for serving at a dinner party or casual get together with friends. The intricate hand embossed design motif accentuates any room in your home, creating a warm and inviting presence with a hint of Moroccan flair. Pair it with the traditional clear glasses and set it next to your tagine, or integrate it into your grandmother’s china – this teapot is truly versatile for any décor. Moroccan tea pots such as this are considered to be a symbol of the Moroccan way of life, an important possession for every household. This traditional style of teapot is used by Moroccans to consume tea at any hour of the day, accompanying practically all meals and encounters, whether they’re formal or just a friendly gathering of friends. The offering of a glass of green tea with mint is a symbol of hospitality. Depending on social rank, teapots are plated with silver or gold and feature rich, elaborate motifs and decorations. The technique of pouring the tea is almost as crucial to the success of hosts as the quality of the tea they use, with hosts often raising the pot up to a meter and using the long, curved spout to accurately pour tea into even the smallest of glasses. Product Features & Highlights Handmade in Fez, Morocco Plated in pure silver Teapot with Integrated Filter For tea bags or loose leaf 34oz (1L) capacity Authentic symbol of Moroccan hospitality Satisfaction guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RqbbXLR5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handmade Moroccan Teapot","source_asin":"B07BQ41T6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BQ41T6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BQ41T6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190199,"name":"Aroma Housewares AIC-224W 4-Quart Wood-Barrel Ice-Cream Maker, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+qcEo36IL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add to the festive mood of any barbeque, birthday party, picnic, or other fun gathering with this electric ice-cream maker. The unit combines old-fashioned charm with modern technology to quickly and easily produce up to 4 quarts of delicious homemade ice cream at a time. Make a creamy batch of chocolate, vanilla, or strawberry, or create custom flavors by mixing any combination of your favorite ingredients. The ice-cream maker features an antique-looking solid pinewood exterior bucket and an interior aluminum mixing canister for fast freezing. Take turns with the traditional hand-operated crank like back in the day or let the machine do the work with its electric motorized crank. Removable parts make cleanup a snap, and a recipe book and instruction manual are included. The electric ice-cream maker measures approximately 12 by 12 by 16 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+qcEo36IL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aroma Housewares","source_asin":"B000TUDVOS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TUDVOS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TUDVOS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190200,"name":"2060 pants Paiman Gamer Definition Throw Pillow Covers 18 X 18 Inch （45 X 45cm） for Couch Farmhouse Outdoor Christmas Pillows Decorative","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xKdqChzmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Aims Luxury And High Quality Home Decor Products To Your Daily Life. Features: Material: The Pillow Covers Are Made Of Plush Fabric, This Fabric Is Also Soft And Pleasant To The Touch.The Fabric Made Of Polyester Material With A Brief Design And Look,Durable And Easy To Look After. Size: 18 X 18 Inch Per Pack, Included 1pc Pillow Covers WORKMANSHIP: Exquisite Hidden Zipper Closure Was Designed For An Elegant Look, HIdden Zipper Design Can Be Opened To Around 34-36 CM For Easy Insertion Of Cushion. About 1.45 Inch Seam Are Done On The Two Margins To Make Sure That The Pillow Will Be Naturally Full All Way Round After The Insert Of The Core. Please Kindly Note: 1. We Offer PILLOW CASE ONLY, The CORE/INSERT EXCLUDED.2. For Manual Measurement'S Sake, Please Accept A 1-2cm More Or Less Allowance.3.PRINT ON BOTH SIDES, WITH EXQUISITE PATTERNS ON BOTH SIDES.4. The Printed Pillow Case My Not Be Identical With The Picture Online, Due To Different Exposure Rate Between Monitors And Naked Eyes. Tips To Stuff Your Insert: Step1. Get The Core Ready, Open The Pillow Case On The Zipper Side, Fold The Core And Put It Inside The Pillow Case To The Bottom. Step2. Let Go Of Your Hand, Make Sure That Your Core Has Stuffed The Corners Of The Pillow Case, Then Close The Zipper Slowly To Make Sure It Doest Not Split. Step3. Slightly Flap On Your Pillow To Make Sure The Core Will Sit Well. Package Content: 1 X Throw Pillow Covers These Throw Pillow Covers Are Designed For Simple Style Home Decor, Cushion Covers Is Available For Different Colors So You Can Match Whichever Color Tone You Like Will Go Best With Your Decors In Living Room, Bedroom, Office And Car. Welcome To Our Store, If You Have Any Question, Pls Feel Free Let Is Know, Thank U And Wish You Have A Happy Shopping Time !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xKdqChzmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"2060 pants","source_asin":"B08CKGHMR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CKGHMR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CKGHMR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
