window.products.push({"id":190328,"name":"Artificial Flowers 10pcs Real Touch Artificial PU Tulip Bouquet Flowers Latex Flowers Plants for Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GUVegrbyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: PU Total Length: approx 13.4\"; Flower heads: 1.8\" high and 1.4\" width Pacakge: 10 pcs artificial tulips are put in a box; Vase is not included Function: 1.The PU Tulips color and shape are very realistic. Use environmentally friendly materials and Suitable for home, garden, exhibition halls, supermarkets, offices, homes and other occasions. 2.Flowers give you the sense of the beauty and a wonderful mood in a day or bring more romantic and relaxed atmosphere for your . Tips: 1.Due to packing requirements, it may little slight deformation, you can blowing cold wind with a hair dryer and adjust the branches to the most natural state with your hands. They will comeback to pretty and real touch feeling! 2.Artificial flowers flower stem length can be adjusted according to the requirements directly: stem is made of steel wires so bend or shape stem by pliers the way you like; You can put the pad in flowers to increase height 3.Flowers can be matched with stone and other decorations Notice: 1.Please understand, due to lighting effects and monitor's brightness/contrast settings or some factors, the color tone of the photos on website may different from the real item. Please take our color description for reference. 2.The production of artificial flowers into many processes , including sticky petals and is completely handmade . Maybe some small particles fall off during transport, this phenomenon is normal. Please gently spread the item after getting it, in case of falling the leaves and flowers. 3.Please don't put artificial plants exposure under the sun for a long time, or they will lose their bright colors and became increasingly bleak. 4.Please don't make long time to put artificial plants in the water, especially hot water, or the artificial flowers' color will fade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GUVegrbyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifelike Artificial Flowers","source_asin":"B073PYT3RM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073PYT3RM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073PYT3RM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190329,"name":"Nestl Throw Pillow Covers, Cozy Velvet Decorative Rust Pillow Covers 20 x 20 Inches, Soft Solid Couch Pillow Covers for Sofa, Bed and Car, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lc4OOcf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber,velvet SOFT VELVET THROW PILLOW COVERS: Lightweight, breathable and cozy, our luxuriously soft throw pillow cases offer soothing, serene comfort that will make you feel refreshed and rejuvenated! THROW COVER 20x20 INCHES: 2-piece set includes two throw pillow covers (insert not included). Each throw pillow cover measures 20”x20” with hidden zipper closure for an elegant, seamless look. IRRESISTIBLE COMFORT & LUXURY: You’ll want to add these cozy pillow covers to every room in the house! Our throw pillow covers are woven from the highest quality microfiber material, double brushed on both sides for ultimate softness and comfort. EASY CARE & CLEANING: Machine wash in cold water; tumble dry on low. They are wrinkle free with no ironing, as well as stain-resistant. Refresh faded bedroom throw pillows with our throw pillow covers and instantly transform your décor! DUE TO MONITOR DIFFERENCES, ACTUAL COLORS MAY VARY SLIGHTLY FROM WHAT APPEARS ONLINE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lc4OOcf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nestl","source_asin":"B0BTTPGCCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTTPGCCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTTPGCCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190330,"name":"Rorence Stainless Steel Potato Ricer with Silicone Grip Handles - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DP7wpQo0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to use a potato ricer to make creamy potatoes? 1. Peel several potatoes and cut them into equally sized pieces, about 1 inch. Cook them in boiling water for about 15 minutes or until they are soft enough to break up if pressed with a fork. 2. Fit the potato ricer with the desired disk, put the inner cylinder on it, and fill the hopper with a few chunks of potatoes. 3. Hold the ricer over the cooking pot, squeeze the handles of the ricer together until the potato puree begins extruding through the holes into the waiting pot. Why Rorence potato ricer? → Made from polished, heavy and high-quality stainless steel. → The handles are soft silicone to make the pressing of the potatoes easier.  → The non-slip silicone knob holds the ricer in place on bowls. → The silicone knob comes with a hanging hole for efficient storage. → 3 interchangeable disks make more than just potatoes. → The inner cup keeps the disc on the bottom during your every squeeze. → The potato ricer helps you create perfectly smooth, fluffy mashed potatoes quickly. → The benefit to using a potato ricer instead of mashing the potatoes by hand is that the potato ricer achieves a uniformly smooth consistency with no lumps. → If you are a mom, the ricer is also perfect for preparing your baby’s and toddler’s food. → Dishwasher safe and easy to clean. → 100% manufactory warranty. If you are not completely satisfied with our product, just return it to Amazone and we will refund you the money back or replace it. Click Add to Cart above and buy it now . Start to enjoy your smooth and fluffy mashed potatoes with the Rorence potato ricer.  Notice: Before first use wash in warm, soapy water and dry thoroughly.  Please ensure that the ricer is dried properly before storing it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DP7wpQo0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rorence","source_asin":"B01I4M0YVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I4M0YVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I4M0YVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
