window.products.push({"id":190335,"name":"Chefman TurboFry 3.7 Quart Air Fryer Oven W/Digital Touch Screen, Cook W/Less Oil, Dishwasher-Safe Flat Basket, 60 Minute Timer, Auto Shutoff, BPA-Fre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x32qSWu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x32qSWu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B091BRC4PB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091BRC4PB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091BRC4PB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190336,"name":"Furinno Moretti Modern Stackable Shelf, French Oak Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qOdoVyJ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Moretti series showcases a collection of furniture that offers the combination of wood and metal. The Modern Lifestyle 2-tier shelf has a sleek and simple design ideal for minimalistic home. It comes with several refreshing color selections that fits most of the room styles. The stackable feature makes the shelf a versatile and flexible piece to own. Add new shelf to existing one to add more storage and display space. The assembly for the shelf is very easy with step by step assembly instructions and all hardware provided along with all the parts. Care instructions: wipe clean with clean damped cloth. Avoid using harsh chemicals. Pictures are for illustration purpose. All decor items are not included in this offer. Pictures are for illustration purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qOdoVyJ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furinno","source_asin":"B08GP4YYWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GP4YYWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GP4YYWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190337,"name":"Leteuke Heavy Duty 3 Tier Rolling Utility Cart,NSF Certified 990Lbs Capacity Rolling Carts with Wheels,Commercial Grade Metal Cart with Handle Bar & S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812q4sw+CtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【NSF-Certified】: Leteuke NSF-certified heavy duty rolling cart is suitable for dry and heated storage environment, will safely store kinds of food or tools, especially designed for kitchen and garage. High quality chrome plated metal cart with electroplated coating for gloss and easy to keep new. Constructed from carbon steel and galvanized structure, and scratch-resistant and wear-resistant surface, makes the shelf more durable. 【Easy to Assemble Metal Utility Cart】: Simple 3 tier rolling cart structure, all parts are in the package, no tools required to assemble. Our utility carts with wheels also can be used as kitchen storage cart, dining cart, service cart, tool cart, etc. Ideal for a variety of environments, like dining rooms, kitchens, restaurants, garages and utility rooms, warehouses, office and studios. NOTE: Please refer to the instruction manual for specific assembly steps. 【3-Tier Adjustable Wire Mesh Shelves】: Designed with adjustable shelves and clips to fix each layer. NOTE: The clips of the same shelf must be fixed at the same height. There are height adjustable in 1 inch increments, you can adjust the height of the shelves of this kitchen cart according to the size of the item. The deep wire basket for placing fragile or pourable items, such as spice jars or glass bottles. Each tier (with wheels) can bear 330 LBS, and the total loading weight is up to 990LBS. 【Multifunctional Rolling Storage Cart】: Non-noise 4 wheels, with 2 locking brakes. * Use leveling feet, more stable and firm on uneven ground. * Use brake wheels, move the utility cart freely and can be locked. Comes with a removable handle bar, easy to push to any place. Remove the handle and use the leveling feet, this rolling utility cart will be a wire shelving unit. 【Includes Hanging Hooks & Shelf Liners】: Packaged with 10pcs S metal hooks (3cm), each hook can bear 22 pounds, which can effectively use the shelf space to hang kitchen supplies or other daily necessities. 3 extra PP shelf liners are included, you can place heated food on it; prevents food from spilling and convenient for you to clean this 3 tier utility cart. NOTE: The high temperature range of liners is 176-212°F. 【Dimension & 100% Customer Service】: This rolling carts with wheels measures 30\"L x 18\"W x 33\"H (without handle); with handle will be 34.75\"L x 18\"W x 33\"H. Leteuke provide 1 year guarantee, is committed to providing professional after-sales service for every customers. If you have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us. Leteuke wishes you a happy life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812q4sw+CtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leteuke","source_asin":"B0BY27LPSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY27LPSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY27LPSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
