window.products.push({"id":190527,"name":"VOGOL Embroidered Elegant Curtains Simple Style Grommmet Window Panels for Bedroom Living Room,Two Panels, 52x63, Pink Floral in White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816NPKXWfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Packaging: Each package contains 2 pieces of embroidered curtains and additional tiebacks to meet daily needs. Each curtain measures W52 x L63, please select the required quantity based on the size of your window. Fabric: This drape is made of polyester fiber fabric, which is soft, comfortable, and durable, able to withstand daily use and environmental factors. Design: The window curtain features a light-colored base and a bright embroidered pattern, which looks bright and elegant overall, creating a warm and bright indoor space. Function: In addition to its beautiful appearance, this curtain panel also has practical functions. It can block sunlight, maintain indoor temperature, protect privacy in daily use, and can also be used as a divider curtain. Washing: This drapery can be machine washed. It is recommended to use a gentle cycle and avoid mixing with dark fabrics. Do not use bleach and use low heat drying. Iron at a low temperature if necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816NPKXWfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOGOL","source_asin":"B07KQ2D1BM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KQ2D1BM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KQ2D1BM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190528,"name":"Lodge LPP3 Cast Iron Square Ribbed Panini Press, 8.25-inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UtLf4K8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For more than 100 years, Lodge has been perfecting the process of making cast iron cookware. They formulate just the right metal chemistry, created exacting mold tolerances for their castings, and developed the perfect wall construction for the best even heating found in cookware. No other cast iron cookware is made to Lodge's strict standards. Handle and press are cast as one piece for decades of cooking. This Ribbed Panini Press is seasoned with oil for a natural, easy-release finish that improves with use. Seasoning is done at the foundry and offers a superior look and performance to home seasoning. And since the seasoning is already done for you, it saves you the time and effort previously needed to season raw cast iron. The Panini Press is a ribbed cast iron plate that works in conjunction with a skillet grill to produce top and bottom searing simultaneously. You can also create mouth-watering steaks and seafood, plus the Panini Press can be used to expel excess fat for a delicious low fat dish! Use on griddles, in skillets or even on the outdoor grill. 8.25\" Square. Fits the Lodge 10.5 inch square skillet and grill pan and round skillets 12 inches or larger. Easy care: hand wash, dry, rub with cooking oil. Made in the USA. What’s with the drip? All Lodge cookware is pre-seasoned with 100% soybean oil, baked onto the surface at a high temperature. Since natural oil melts at this high temperature and the cookware hangs as it dries, some finished pieces experience a bubble in the seasoning, visibly known as the drip. This brownish color is not a defect; it’s simply the hardened cooking oil. It does not affect performance and will go away in time as you continue to cook and season the item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UtLf4K8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B0BM89PWWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM89PWWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM89PWWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
