window.products.push({"id":190754,"name":"Microwave Potato Bag - Apple Orchard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RsScb0xAL._AC_.jpg","description":"This microwave potato bag shows delicious, fresh crisp red, green, and golden apples just waiting to be eaten. Our regular size premium microwave potato bags measure approximately 10x10 inches. They will hold 1-4 medium sized potatoes or 1-2 sweet potatoes. Each bag is hand made with a 100% cotton inner core sandwiched between a cotton muslin and a cotton outer shell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RsScb0xAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MicrowavePotatoBags.com","source_asin":"B009G9H7J8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009G9H7J8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009G9H7J8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190755,"name":"VIOCIWUO Artificial Red Peppers Succulent Plants Hanging Artificial Hanging Plants Decor Wall Apartment Home Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hFz71ngRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY: High-simulation plant wall hangings with natural texture, creating a refreshing summer feeling with a breath of life. Can be stored for a long time without deformation and discoloration. Clean with a rag, convenient and clean. MATERIAL & SIZE: Made of plastic. Stick length: 15.7 inch, the length of pepper string is about 24inch. PACKAGE INCLUDE: 11 artificial succulents shaped like pearl strings, 1 wooden stick and 10m jute rope, 3pcs artificial red pepper. WIDELY USED: Artificial succulent wall decorations are realistic and beautiful, can be hung in the bedroom, living room, office or apartment, etc. Widely used for farm, kitchen, table, pub ornaments, supermarket display, children preschool education tools, photography prop. NOTICE: Please do not expose artificial plants to sunlight for a long time, otherwise the color will change. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hFz71ngRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIOCIWUO","source_asin":"B0BBZRKBD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBZRKBD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBZRKBD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190756,"name":"Zulay Powerful Milk Frother for Coffee with Upgraded Titanium Motor - Handheld Frother Whisk, Milk Foamer, Mini Blender and Electric Mixer Coffee Frot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ab6nI+ikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Rich, Creamy Froth In Seconds: We coffee lovers are serious when it comes to our coffee. The Milk Boss Frother gives that professional finishing touch to your latte, cappuccino, macchiato or hot chocolate. Make delicious foamy creamer for your drinks at home with your own milk frother. The benefits of having your own electric drink whisk mixer are endless, you can make your own best latte, you know yours tastes the best. Matcha Whisking, Coffee & More: Works better than a manual matcha whisk for making matcha tea and works far better than fork or whisk for coffee. It works very well to mix nutritious protein powder drinks with no extra container, blender or bottle shaker to wash. Use our mini mixer for your whisking and mixing needs: Give healthy shakes and smoothies a kick by adding powder or egg nog flavor and mixing. Enjoy Proven and Trusted Quality: We use only premium materials. The construction will last, backed by our Zulay Guarantee to not rust or break, ever. Our small and efficient frother works on all types of milk - creamer, soy, almond, cashew, hazelnut, whole milk, and other dairy such as butter or cream. Easy To Clean And Store: Cleanup for this matcha wisk & frother is even faster. To clean just put the whisk in hot running water and briefly turn it on – instantly clean! When stored on counter or table it sits nicely next to other coffee bar accessories. Our powerful and durable hand-held milk frother is powered by two AA batteries (not included) with a compact electric design that easily fits in a drawer. No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our milk frother and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. Have the confidence that this frother will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not make your foam exactly how you want it, we got you covered. Happy Frothing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ab6nI+ikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BS9YMXLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS9YMXLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS9YMXLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190757,"name":"YOIOZAIZAI Pillow Covers Set of 4 Solid Color Pillows Soft Decorative Square Couch Pillow Covers Home Neutral Decor for Sofa Bedroom Car Couch (Miss, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGdiFiUeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Velvet 🎁High-Quality Velvet Material: Made of high-quality Velvet material, durable and not deformed. It has good ventilation function, beautiful, comfortable and soft. The four sides of the pillowcase are sewn firmly, and it is not easy to open the thread, deform and pilling. 🎁Standard Size:18*18 inches, manual measurement, please allow 1-2cm error, pillow covers only, insert not included. 🎁Skin-Friendly Material: High-quality and breathable and Velvet fabrics and handmade craftsmanship make uncomfortable furniture comfortable. There are 18\" X 18\" throw pillow covers that allow you to relax near the fireplace without itching. In the cold season, you can lie on the sofa and enjoy soft pillow covers to warm up. 🎁Easy To Wear: invisible zipper is good quality and works smoothly, so you neither see nor feel them while using, we also expand the opening of each throw pillows cushion case. The sewing reinforcement at the end of the zipper of the pillowcase makes it difficult to wear and tear.Therefore, filling pillows/stuffs in these pillowcases will be very easy. 🎁Applicable Occasions: happy throw pillow covers in different color are essential decorations for modern home fashion. They are suitable for living room, bedroom, sofa,bed, office, balcony, entrance, etc, adding color to your place and fashion. 🎁Washing Guidiance: Machine wash separately in cold water at gentle cycle, or wash by hand, tumble dry low, do not bleach and iron. Do not mix and wash with other easy-to-fade clothing to avoid staining and affect use. 🎁WARM TIPS: Due to different screen display, the color of actual pillow covers may vary slightly from images. If you don't 100% love our products, please don't hesitate to contact us, and we do our best to make sure you are satisfied again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGdiFiUeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOIOZAIZAI","source_asin":"B0B8CYD87Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8CYD87Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8CYD87Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
