window.products.push({"id":190957,"name":"Wooden Cutting Board Shapes, 14\" with Handle, Pack of 5 Wooden Cutting Boards by Woodpeckers, for Kitchen, Decor, and Charcuterie Boards","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EmGQvetuS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"NOT JUST FOR CUTTING -- These cutting board shapes are not just for chopping your chicken and vegetables! Pile them with cheese and meats for an elegant charcuterie board, or get creative with fruits, breakfast foods, or even chocolates for a unique display. JUST WAITING TO BE DECORATED - These plain wooden cutting boards are practically begging for you to get crafting. Personalize them with paint, wood burning, or resin art. Then add them to your home decor—spruce up a space by using them as a base for displays. THE PERFECT GIFT -- Never stress over gift-giving again. These cutting board shapes make the perfect gift! Decorate them, then pair with a cookbook for a brag-worthy gift. Or load it with meat and cheese for a present that tastes as good as it looks! QUALITY THAT MAKES THE CUT -- If you need one thing to be sturdy, it's your wood board! Made of 1/4\" birch plywood, this cool cutting board is made to withstand heavy resin pours. And its 14\" size and handle make it practical and versatile as ever. WOOD PARTS FOR CRAFTERS, BY CRAFTERS - At Woodpeckers, crafting and building with wood is our thing. Bringing you more delightful wooden craft supplies is our fun. And seeing pics of your creative creations - that's our after-we-finish-today's-work TREAT! Questions about your wooden cutting board shape? Please do get in touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EmGQvetuS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woodpeckers","source_asin":"B099LJS5ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099LJS5ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099LJS5ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190958,"name":"DCI Re-Usable Drink Markers Drink Notes, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EuQxqnTcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Identify who's wine glass is who's at your next gathering with these fun glass markers. Use the dry erase marker, or other non-permanent pen, to write guest names on the drink note. Wipes off easily for your next party! Set of 6 reusable silicone drink tags with dry erase marker. Tags state: \"HELLO, My name is....\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EuQxqnTcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DCI","source_asin":"B004SUIX5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004SUIX5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004SUIX5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190959,"name":"PackIt Fully Freezable Everyday Lunch Box Cooler, Navy Leaves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FvVWHcMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Freezable Lunch Box Cooler was designed to work alongside you all day. The cube shaped cooler provides enough room to bring your breakfast and lunch, a drink and a handful of snacks to work. Perfect for the avid meal prepper, the commuter, at the office, or on the job site. On the weekends, pack the Everyday Lunch Box Cooler with up to 9 cans of 12oz beverages along with your favorite snacks to the beach or on a quick day trip. The adjustable shoulder strap can be worn across the body, over the shoulder, or shortened to use as a handle. Best of all, the Everyday Lunch Box Cooler features PackIt's groundbreaking technology: a freezable non-toxic gel liner is integrated into the walls of the lunch box. The design totally eliminates the need for separate ice packs or gel packs. Frozen walls means built-in cooling that chills food and drinks for hours! To use, simply flatten the bag and place the entire bag in the freezer overnight. In the morning, the walls of the bag will be completely frozen and ready to pack. The Everyday Lunch Box Cooler boasts a large flip top opening that allows for faster top-load packing and lets you see exactly where items are stored. Like all PackIt products, the Everyday Lunch Box Cooler is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. PackIt's Freezable Everyday Lunch Box Cooler measures 7.5 inches tall, 9.5 inches wide and 7 inches deep while open. When folded, it measures only 2 inches tall, 7 inches wide and 9.5 inches long for easy stacking and storage in the freezer. It will hold a PackIt Mod Lunch Bento and a Mod Snack Bento or a Flex Bento Food Storage Container (sold separately on Amazon). Cleaning is easy: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FvVWHcMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B08WY18WJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WY18WJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WY18WJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":190960,"name":"Moroccan Trellis Design Modern Area Rug Lattice Rugs Modela Collection (Navy Blue, 7'9\" x 9'10\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bIRf26rML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modela Collection is Affordable, Better Pile and Weight in Similar Quality Catagory Machine-Made Area Rug Made in Turkey and Using 100% Olefin/Polypropylene Pile by Usa Base Company Purhome. Our Area Rugs are Pet Friendly, Low pile, Stain Resistant and Affordable for All Budgets. Care Instructions : Vacuum, Shake and Rotate The Rug Regularly. Remove Dried Spots Immediately by Scraping Carefully Towards The Middle of The Spot. Do not Rub Wet Spots. Absorb Moisture with Paper Towels, and Clean with a Damp Cloth and Mild Detergent. Approx Size : 7'9\" x 9'10\" (Width: 93 inch Length: 118 inch)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bIRf26rML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RugStylesOnline","source_asin":"B00VKXNZ26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VKXNZ26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VKXNZ26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
