window.products.push({"id":190974,"name":"RRD Mounted Quilt Rack with Shelf – Amish Made Quilt Hangers for Wall Hangings with Display Shelf – Rustic Quilt Wall Hangers for Twin to King Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iF8YqutBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC RED DOOR BLANKET HANGING RACK W/ SHELF (7” D x 42” L): Our hanging quilt rack display is hand-crafted with great care to ensure the highest quality and made in the U.S.A. This hang quilt on wall display rack is made of solid brown maple wood and finished with a grey stain to look beautiful alongside your eye-catching quilts. Our Amish-made comforter rack has mounting screws and matching wooden plugs. Now the tough part: which of her incredible, hand-sewn quilts do you choose to display on your wall? --- FEATURES: The quilt holder rack is made from a solid brown maple wood with a grey stain. – Our wall blanket hanger shelves range from 30” – 72” in length and have mounting screws and matching wooden plugs. –Decorative grey stain brings out the solid wood’s natural beauty. – A removable quilt hanger rod allows you to easily change out your quilts as much as you’d like. --- This blanket rack for wall is available in 3 wood choices: Oak, Cherry, and Maple. -Our blanket wall rack features a variety of stain options: Ebony, Cherry, Coffee, Fruitwood, Michaels, Natural, Slate Grey, and White. -The quilt hanger with shelf also ranges in sizes from 30”, 36”, 42”, 48”, 60” and 72”. --- ABOUT US: Rustic Red Door is locally owned, and family operated with the primary goal of serving you. We want you to experience the genuine satisfaction that comes from owning solid wood, handcrafted, American-made furniture that will be valued, cherished, and handed down from generation to generation. Our fervent hope is for each heirloom-quality piece to be used as a significant part of extending hospitality towards others just as the expectations of benevolence were passed on to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iF8YqutBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rustic Red Door Co.","source_asin":"B0813Y7N85","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-190974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0813Y7N85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0813Y7N85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
